    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n392" root="اخر" body-key="A">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المُؤَخِّرُ</span></b>  a name of God, [<i>The Postponer,</i> or
<i>Delayer;</i>] <i>He who postpones,</i> or <i>delays, things,
and puts them in their places:</i> [or <i>He who puts,</i>
or <i>keeps, back,</i> or <i>backward:</i> or <i>He who degrades:</i>]
contr. <i>of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المُقَدِّمُ</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُؤَخِّرُ الَّرحْلِ</span>, and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُؤَخِّرَتُهُ</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آخِرٌ</span>.

